第一波攻势终于退去，许多士兵挂着惊魂未定的神情，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73225AA3B726C1BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064404016:0":{"text":"우리가 이겼다! 안식의 성을 지켰어!","source_cn":"我们、我们赢了！安息城守住了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4E6F1BAE0B2F3EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064404017:0":{"text":"진정해라! 이번 공격은 탐색전에 불과하다. 진정한 위협은 아직 시작도 안 했다!","source_cn":"冷静！这只是一次试探，真正的风暴尚未到来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CA434D83DF3CBA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064404018:0":{"text":"사상자를 파악하고 화살과 바위를 보충해라. 전원, 절대 경계를 늦추지 마라!","source_cn":"清点伤亡，补充箭矢滚石。所有人，保持警惕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD8C3A941C8E821","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064404019:0":{"text":"네, 장군님!","source_cn":"是！将军！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1E3E24245682F01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:33:1064404020:0":{"text":"이후 사흘 동안, 안식의 성은 피바람에 휩싸였다...","source_cn":"接下来三天，安息城陷入血色风暴中……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D91DBA085FF4D4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"